# Machine 1: L = { aⁿbᵐ | m ≥ n, n > 0 }
#
# Each round marks the first free a as X and the first free b as Y. When no
# free a is left, the rest of the tape must hold only Y and b.
#
# q0  marks the next a. If the next cell is Y, all of the a are marked. At the
#     start, a b or a blank stops the machine: n = 0.
# q1  goes right to the first free b and marks it. A blank stops the machine:
#     m < n.
# q2  goes back left to the last X.
# q3  checks that only Y and b come before the blank. An a stops the machine.
# q4  accepts.

# Q
q0 q1 q2 q3 q4
# Σ
a b
# Γ
a b X Y _
# q0
q0
# b
_
# F
q4
# number of tapes
1
# δ: from read to write move
q0 a q1 X R
q0 Y q3 Y R
q1 a q1 a R
q1 Y q1 Y R
q1 b q2 Y L
q2 a q2 a L
q2 Y q2 Y L
q2 X q0 X R
q3 Y q3 Y R
q3 b q3 b R
q3 _ q4 _ S
